       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
      *****************************************************************
      * CABING10 - JURISDICTIONAL PRE-EDIT / INDETERMINATE RESOLUTION *
      * APPLICATION : CABS                                            *
      * INPUTS      : ENRIN   TELCABS.CABS.USAGE.ENRICH(0) CABSCDR    *
      *               FCTRIN  TELCABS.CABS.FACTOR  VSAM KSDS CABSFCTR *
      *               CARRMST TELCABS.CABS.CARRIER VSAM KSDS CABSCARR *
      * OUTPUTS     : JUROUT  TELCABS.CABS.USAGE.JURIS(+1) CABSCDR    *
      *               SUSOUT  TELCABS.CABS.USAGE.SUSPENSE(+1) CABSERR *
      * CONTROL     : CTLOUT                               CABSCTL    *
      * BALANCE     : CT-READ = CT-WRITTEN + CT-REJECTED +            *
      *               CT-SUMMARISED + CT-CARRIED-FWD (SUMM AND CFWD   *
      *               ARE ALWAYS ZERO - EVERY RECORD GOES TO EITHER   *
      *               JUROUT OR SUSOUT, NEVER BOTH)                   *
      * RESTART     : FULL RERUN                                     *
      * REVISION HISTORY                                              *
      *   V1.00  1989-02-14  R.T.WHEELER  INITIAL JURISDICTION EDIT   *
      *                      - LATA COMPARE ONLY, NO FACTOR LOOKUP    *
      *   V1.01  1991-06-30  D.OKONKWO    ADDED PIU/PLU FACTOR READ   *
      *                      AGAINST FCTRIN FOR INDETERMINATE RECS    *
      *   V1.02  1994-11-02  J.M.CASTILLO CARRIER DEFAULT FALLBACK    *
      *                      WHEN NO QUARTERLY FACTOR ON FILE         *
      *   V1.03  1998-03-19  P.NAIR       TARIFF DEFAULT 0.50000      *
      *                      FALLBACK - LAST RESORT, SEE P2600        *
      *   V2.00  2003-09-08  A.BUKOWSKI   NPA-BASED INTRASTATE RULE   *
      *                      REWORKED FOR NPA SPLIT OVERLAYS          *
      *   V2.01  2008-01-22  L.FERREIRA   PIU RANGE EDIT EC-014 ADDED,*
      *                      REJECTS ANY FACTOR OUTSIDE 0.0 TO 1.0    *
      *   V2.02  2013-05-14  S.MARCHETTI  RECOMPILE - LE V8 MIGRATION,*
      *                      NO LOGIC CHANGE                          *
      *   V2.03  2019-07-30  T.VANCE      MINUTES SPLIT NOW ROUNDS    *
      *                      BOTH INTERSTATE AND INTRASTATE PORTIONS  *
      *****************************************************************
       PROGRAM-ID.    CABING10.
       AUTHOR.        RADIANT-DIGITAL-CABS-TEAM.
       DATE-WRITTEN.  1989-02-14.
       DATE-COMPILED.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.   IBM-370.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.   IBM-370.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT ENRIN   ASSIGN TO ENRIN
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS  IS WS-FS-INPUT.
           SELECT FCTRIN  ASSIGN TO FCTRIN
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE  IS RANDOM
               RECORD KEY   IS FC-KEY
               FILE STATUS  IS WS-FS-TABLE.
           SELECT CARRMST ASSIGN TO CARRMST
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE  IS RANDOM
               RECORD KEY   IS CR-OCN
               FILE STATUS  IS WS-FS-CARR.
           SELECT JUROUT  ASSIGN TO JUROUT
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS  IS WS-FS-OUTPUT.
           SELECT SUSOUT  ASSIGN TO SUSOUT
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS  IS WS-FS-SUSPENSE.
           SELECT CTLOUT  ASSIGN TO CTLOUT
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS  IS WS-FS-CONTROL.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  ENRIN
           RECORDING MODE IS F
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           BLOCK CONTAINS 0 RECORDS
           RECORD CONTAINS 200 CHARACTERS.
           COPY CABSCDR.

       FD  FCTRIN
           RECORDING MODE IS F
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY CABSFCTR.

       FD  CARRMST
           RECORDING MODE IS F
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
           COPY CABSCARR.

       FD  JUROUT
           RECORDING MODE IS F
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           BLOCK CONTAINS 0 RECORDS
           RECORD CONTAINS 200 CHARACTERS.
       01  JUR-OUT-RECORD              PIC X(200).

       FD  SUSOUT
           RECORDING MODE IS F
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           BLOCK CONTAINS 0 RECORDS
           RECORD CONTAINS 300 CHARACTERS.
       01  SUS-OUT-RECORD              PIC X(300).

       FD  CTLOUT
           RECORDING MODE IS F
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           BLOCK CONTAINS 0 RECORDS
           RECORD CONTAINS 180 CHARACTERS.
       01  CTL-OUT-RECORD              PIC X(180).

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY CABSWRK.

      * OWN WORKING STORAGE FOLLOWS - CABSWRK SUPPLIES THE STANDARD
      * SWITCHES, COUNTERS, ACCUMULATORS, FILE STATUS, ERROR CODES,
      * SUSPENSE LAYOUT, DATE WORK AREA AND CONTROL RECORD.
       01  WS-PGM-CONSTANTS.
           05  WS-PGM-NAME             PIC X(08) VALUE 'CABING10'.

       01  WS-ADDL-FILE-STATUS.
           05  WS-FS-CARR              PIC X(02) VALUE '00'.

       01  WS-CYCLE-DATE-WORK.
           05  WS-CYCLE-YYDDD          PIC 9(05).
           05  WS-CYCLE-YYDDD-R REDEFINES WS-CYCLE-YYDDD.
               10  WS-CYCLE-YY          PIC 9(02).
               10  WS-CYCLE-DDD         PIC 9(03).

      * NPA EXTRACTED FROM THE 6-DIGIT NPANXX VIA ARITHMETIC, NOT
      * REFERENCE MODIFICATION.  INTEGER DIVIDE TRUNCATES THE NXX.
       01  WS-NPA-SPLIT-WORK.
           05  WS-ORIG-NPA              PIC 9(03).
           05  WS-TERM-NPA              PIC 9(03).

      * CABS-STD-006 - WS-JUR-CLASS 88-LEVELS OVERLAP ON 'X'.
      * WS-JUR-SEPARATED COVERS I / S / X, WS-JUR-NEEDS-FACTOR
      * COVERS X / SPACE / L.  BOTH ARE TRUE WHEN THE VALUE IS 'X'.
      * WHICHEVER CONDITION IS TESTED FIRST IN P2300 DECIDES WHETHER
      * THE PIU/PLU FACTOR ACTUALLY GETS APPLIED - SEE P2300.
       01  WS-JURIS-WORK.
           05  WS-JUR-CLASS             PIC X(01) VALUE SPACE.
               88  WS-JUR-SEPARATED       VALUE 'I' 'S' 'X'.
               88  WS-JUR-NEEDS-FACTOR    VALUE 'X' ' ' 'L'.

      * FACTOR LOOKUP KEY - BUILT HERE THEN MOVED TO FC-KEY SO THE
      * SEARCH KEY SURVIVES EVEN WHEN FCTRIN READ FAILS.
       01  WS-FACTOR-KEY-WORK.
           05  WS-FK-OCN                PIC X(04).
           05  WS-FK-STATE-CD           PIC X(02).
           05  WS-FK-LATA               PIC 9(03).
           05  WS-FK-EFF-YYDDD          PIC 9(05).
      * SPLIT VIEW OF THE EFFECTIVE DATE - USED WHEN THE SUSPENSE
      * DETAIL FOR EC-FACTOR-MISSING NEEDS THE YEAR IN ISOLATION.
           05  WS-FK-EFF-R REDEFINES WS-FK-EFF-YYDDD.
               10  WS-FK-EFF-YY          PIC 9(02).
               10  WS-FK-EFF-DDD         PIC 9(03).

       01  WS-STATE-DERIVE-WORK.
           05  WS-STATE-CD              PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
           05  WS-STATE-FOUND-SW        PIC X(01) VALUE 'N'.
               88  WS-STATE-FOUND         VALUE 'Y'.
           05  WS-STATE-SUB             PIC S9(03) COMP-3.

      * CABS-STD-004 - HARDCODED NPA-TO-STATE TABLE, LOADED VIA
      * REDEFINES OF A LITERAL AREA, NOT INITIALIZE.
       01  WS-NPA-STATE-LITERALS.
           05  FILLER PIC X(50) VALUE
               '212NY214TX305WI404GA503OR615TN702ND802VT916CAXXX'.
       01  WS-NPA-STATE-TAB REDEFINES WS-NPA-STATE-LITERALS.
           05  WS-NST-ENTRY OCCURS 10 TIMES.
               10  WS-NST-NPA           PIC 9(03).
               10  WS-NST-STATE         PIC X(02).

       01  WS-FACTOR-FOUND-WORK.
           05  WS-FACTOR-FOUND-SW       PIC X(01) VALUE 'N'.
               88  WS-FACTOR-FOUND        VALUE 'Y'.

       01  WS-CARRIER-FOUND-WORK.
           05  WS-CARRIER-FOUND-SW      PIC X(01) VALUE 'N'.
               88  WS-CARRIER-FOUND       VALUE 'Y'.

      * THE FACTOR ACTUALLY APPLIED - CASCADES FROM FCTRIN, TO THE
      * CARRIER MASTER DEFAULT, TO THE HARDCODED TARIFF DEFAULT.
       01  WS-EFFECTIVE-FACTOR-WORK.
           05  WS-EFFECTIVE-PIU         PIC S9(03)V9(05) COMP-3.
           05  WS-EFFECTIVE-PLU         PIC S9(03)V9(05) COMP-3.
           05  WS-FACTOR-SOURCE-CD      PIC X(01) VALUE SPACE.
               88  WS-FACTOR-FROM-FCTRIN   VALUE 'F'.
               88  WS-FACTOR-FROM-CARRIER  VALUE 'C'.
               88  WS-FACTOR-FROM-TARIFF   VALUE 'T'.

      * ALTERNATE DISPLAY VIEW OF THE EFFECTIVE FACTOR PAIR, USED
      * WHEN THE SUSPENSE RECORD NEEDS A READABLE FACTOR SNAPSHOT.
       01  WS-EFFECTIVE-FACTOR-ALT REDEFINES WS-EFFECTIVE-FACTOR-WORK.
           05  WS-EFF-PIU-ALT           PIC X(03).
           05  WS-EFF-PLU-ALT           PIC X(03).
           05  WS-EFF-SRC-ALT           PIC X(01).

       01  WS-TARIFF-DEFAULT-WORK.
           05  WS-TARIFF-PIU-DEFAULT    PIC S9(03)V9(05) COMP-3
                                        VALUE 0.50000.

       01  WS-PIU-RANGE-WORK.
           05  WS-PIU-LOW-LIMIT         PIC S9(03)V9(05) COMP-3
                                        VALUE 0.
           05  WS-PIU-HIGH-LIMIT        PIC S9(03)V9(05) COMP-3
                                        VALUE 1.00000.

       01  WS-SPLIT-MINUTES-WORK.
           05  WS-TOTAL-MIN             PIC S9(07)V9(02) COMP-3.
           05  WS-INTERSTATE-MIN        PIC S9(07)V9(02) COMP-3.
           05  WS-INTRASTATE-MIN        PIC S9(07)V9(02) COMP-3.

       01  WS-EDIT-RESULT-WORK.
           05  WS-REC-VALID-SW          PIC X(01) VALUE 'Y'.
               88  WS-REC-VALID           VALUE 'Y'.
           05  WS-FAIL-ERR-CD           PIC X(04) VALUE SPACES.

       01  WS-CABDTCNV-PARMS.
           05  CV-FUNCTION-CD           PIC X(01) VALUE '1'.
           05  CV-YYDDD-IN              PIC 9(05).
           05  CV-PIVOT-YY              PIC 9(02).
           05  CV-CCYYMMDD-OUT          PIC 9(08).
           05  CV-RETURN-CD             PIC X(02).

       01  WS-CABOCNVL-PARMS.
           05  OV-OCN-IN                PIC X(04).
           05  OV-EFF-YYDDD-IN          PIC 9(05).
           05  OV-FOUND-SW              PIC X(01).
               88  OV-OCN-FOUND           VALUE 'Y'.
           05  OV-EFFECTIVE-SW          PIC X(01).
               88  OV-OCN-EFFECTIVE       VALUE 'Y'.

       01  WS-CABHASH-PARMS.
           05  HS-HASH-SEQ-IN           PIC S9(09) COMP-3.
           05  HS-HASH-OCN-IN           PIC X(04).

       01  WS-SUSPENSE-BUILD-WORK.
           05  WS-DETECT-PARA-LIT       PIC X(30).

       01  WS-CONTROL-BUILD-WORK.
           05  WS-CTL-STEP-SAVE         PIC X(08) VALUE 'S200PROC'.

       01  WS-ABEND-WORK.
           05  WS-ABEND-CD              PIC X(04).
           05  WS-ABEND-RSN             PIC X(40).

       01  WS-MISC-FLAGS.
           05  WS-DEBUG-SW              PIC X(01) VALUE 'N'.
               88  WS-DEBUG-ON            VALUE 'Y'.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

       S000-MAINLINE SECTION.
       P0000-MAINLINE.
           PERFORM P1000-INIT THRU P1000-EXIT.
           PERFORM P2000-PROCESS THRU P2000-EXIT
               UNTIL WS-EOF.
           PERFORM P8000-CONTROL THRU P8000-EXIT.
           PERFORM P9000-TERM THRU P9000-EXIT.
           STOP RUN.

       S100-INIT SECTION.
       P1000-INIT.
           PERFORM P1100-OPEN-FILES THRU P1100-EXIT.
           PERFORM P1200-INIT-CONTROL-KEY THRU P1200-EXIT.
           PERFORM P2100-READ-ENRIN THRU P2100-EXIT.
       P1000-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       P1100-OPEN-FILES.
           OPEN INPUT  ENRIN.
           OPEN INPUT  FCTRIN.
           OPEN INPUT  CARRMST.
           OPEN OUTPUT JUROUT.
           OPEN OUTPUT SUSOUT.
           OPEN OUTPUT CTLOUT.
           IF WS-FS-INPUT NOT = '00'
               MOVE 'I010' TO WS-ABEND-CD
               MOVE 'CABING10 - ENRIN OPEN FAILED' TO WS-ABEND-RSN
               CALL 'CABABEND' USING WS-ABEND-CD WS-ABEND-RSN.
       P1100-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       P1200-INIT-CONTROL-KEY.
           MOVE 'CABI10RUN001' TO CT-RUN-ID.
           MOVE WS-PGM-NAME    TO CT-PROCESS-ID.
           MOVE 1              TO CT-STEP-SEQ.
           MOVE '1'            TO CV-FUNCTION-CD.
           MOVE ZERO           TO CV-YYDDD-IN.
           MOVE DW-PIVOT-YY    TO CV-PIVOT-YY.
           CALL 'CABDTCNV' USING WS-CABDTCNV-PARMS.
           MOVE CV-YYDDD-IN    TO WS-CYCLE-YYDDD.
           MOVE WS-CYCLE-YYDDD TO CT-CYCLE-YYDDD.
       P1200-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       S200-PROCESS SECTION.
       P2000-PROCESS.
           MOVE 'Y' TO WS-REC-VALID-SW.
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-FAIL-ERR-CD.
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-JUR-CLASS.
           PERFORM P2200-EDIT-JURIS THRU P2200-EXIT.
           PERFORM P2300-RESOLVE-INDETERMINATE THRU P2300-EXIT.
           IF WS-REC-VALID
               PERFORM P2800-VALIDATE-PIU-RANGE THRU P2800-EXIT.
           IF WS-REC-VALID
               PERFORM P2900-WRITE-JUROUT THRU P2900-EXIT
           ELSE
               PERFORM P3000-BUILD-SUSPENSE THRU P3000-EXIT.
           PERFORM P2100-READ-ENRIN THRU P2100-EXIT.
       P2000-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       P2100-READ-ENRIN.
           READ ENRIN
               AT END
                   MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF-SW
               NOT AT END
                   ADD 1 TO WS-READ-CNT.
       P2100-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      * DECIDES INTERSTATE / INTRASTATE / LOCAL FROM THE LATA PAIR
      * AND THE ORIGINATING/TERMINATING NPA.  SAME LATA IS LOCAL.
      * DIFFERENT LATA, SAME NPA IS TREATED AS INTRASTATE.  DIFFERENT
      * LATA AND DIFFERENT NPA CANNOT BE RESOLVED FROM THIS DATA
      * ALONE AND IS STAMPED INDETERMINATE FOR FACTOR RESOLUTION.
       P2200-EDIT-JURIS.
           COMPUTE WS-ORIG-NPA = CD-VC-ORIG-NPANXX / 1000.
           COMPUTE WS-TERM-NPA = CD-VC-TERM-NPANXX / 1000.
           IF CD-VC-ORIG-LATA = CD-VC-TERM-LATA
               MOVE 'L' TO CD-JURIS-CD
               MOVE 'L' TO WS-JUR-CLASS
           ELSE
               IF WS-ORIG-NPA = WS-TERM-NPA
                   MOVE 'S' TO CD-JURIS-CD
                   MOVE 'S' TO WS-JUR-CLASS
               ELSE
                   MOVE 'X' TO CD-JURIS-CD
                   MOVE 'X' TO WS-JUR-CLASS.
       P2200-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      * CABS-STD-006 - WS-JUR-SEPARATED (I/S/X) IS TESTED BEFORE
      * WS-JUR-NEEDS-FACTOR (X/SPACE/L).  A CLASS OF 'X' SATISFIES
      * WS-JUR-SEPARATED SO THE ROUTINE EXITS BEFORE THE FACTOR
      * LOOKUP RUNS - INDETERMINATE RECORDS RIDE THROUGH ON WHATEVER
      * PIU/PLU WAS LAST LEFT IN WORKING STORAGE UNLESS A PRIOR
      * RECORD HAPPENED TO POPULATE IT.  REVERSING THE TWO IF TESTS
      * WOULD CHANGE THE OUTCOME FOR EVERY INDETERMINATE RECORD.
       P2300-RESOLVE-INDETERMINATE.
           IF WS-JUR-SEPARATED
               GO TO P2300-EXIT.
           IF WS-JUR-NEEDS-FACTOR
               PERFORM P2400-LOOKUP-FACTOR THRU P2400-EXIT
               PERFORM P2700-SPLIT-MINUTES THRU P2700-EXIT.
       P2300-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      * KEYED READ OF THE QUARTERLY PIU/PLU FACTOR.  FALLS BACK TO
      * THE CARRIER MASTER, THEN TO THE HARDCODED TARIFF DEFAULT.
       P2400-LOOKUP-FACTOR.
           MOVE CD-OCN         TO WS-FK-OCN.
           PERFORM P2450-DERIVE-STATE THRU P2450-EXIT.
           MOVE WS-STATE-CD    TO WS-FK-STATE-CD.
           MOVE CD-VC-ORIG-LATA TO WS-FK-LATA.
           MOVE WS-CYCLE-YYDDD TO WS-FK-EFF-YYDDD.
           MOVE WS-FK-OCN      TO FC-OCN.
           MOVE WS-FK-STATE-CD TO FC-STATE-CD.
           MOVE WS-FK-LATA     TO FC-LATA.
           MOVE WS-FK-EFF-YYDDD TO FC-EFF-YYDDD.
           READ FCTRIN
               INVALID KEY
                   MOVE 'N' TO WS-FACTOR-FOUND-SW.
           IF WS-FS-TABLE = '00'
               MOVE 'Y' TO WS-FACTOR-FOUND-SW
               MOVE FC-PIU TO WS-EFFECTIVE-PIU
               MOVE FC-PLU TO WS-EFFECTIVE-PLU
               MOVE 'F'    TO WS-FACTOR-SOURCE-CD
           ELSE
               MOVE 'N' TO WS-FACTOR-FOUND-SW.
           IF NOT WS-FACTOR-FOUND
               PERFORM P2500-LOOKUP-CARRIER-DEFAULT THRU P2500-EXIT.
       P2400-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      * LINEAR SEARCH OF THE HARDCODED NPA-TO-STATE TABLE.  NOT
      * FOUND LEAVES WS-STATE-CD AS SPACES - THE FACTOR READ THEN
      * SIMPLY MISSES AND FALLS THROUGH THE CASCADE BELOW.
       P2450-DERIVE-STATE.
           MOVE 'N' TO WS-STATE-FOUND-SW.
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-STATE-CD.
           PERFORM P2460-SCAN-STATE-TAB THRU P2460-EXIT
               VARYING WS-STATE-SUB FROM 1 BY 1
               UNTIL WS-STATE-SUB > 10
               OR WS-STATE-FOUND.
       P2450-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       P2460-SCAN-STATE-TAB.
           IF WS-NST-NPA (WS-STATE-SUB) = WS-ORIG-NPA
               MOVE WS-NST-STATE (WS-STATE-SUB) TO WS-STATE-CD
               MOVE 'Y' TO WS-STATE-FOUND-SW.
       P2460-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      * FALLBACK TO CR-DEFAULT-PIU / CR-DEFAULT-PLU FROM THE CARRIER
      * MASTER.  CABOCNVL CONFIRMS THE OCN IS STILL EFFECTIVE BEFORE
      * THE DEFAULT IS TRUSTED.
       P2500-LOOKUP-CARRIER-DEFAULT.
           MOVE CD-OCN TO CR-OCN.
           READ CARRMST
               INVALID KEY
                   MOVE 'N' TO WS-CARRIER-FOUND-SW.
           IF WS-FS-CARR = '00'
               MOVE 'Y' TO WS-CARRIER-FOUND-SW
           ELSE
               MOVE 'N' TO WS-CARRIER-FOUND-SW.
           IF WS-CARRIER-FOUND
               MOVE CD-OCN         TO OV-OCN-IN
               MOVE WS-CYCLE-YYDDD TO OV-EFF-YYDDD-IN
               CALL 'CABOCNVL' USING WS-CABOCNVL-PARMS
               IF OV-OCN-EFFECTIVE
                   MOVE CR-DEFAULT-PIU TO WS-EFFECTIVE-PIU
                   MOVE CR-DEFAULT-PLU TO WS-EFFECTIVE-PLU
                   MOVE 'C'            TO WS-FACTOR-SOURCE-CD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 'N' TO WS-CARRIER-FOUND-SW.
           IF NOT WS-CARRIER-FOUND
               PERFORM P2600-APPLY-TARIFF-DEFAULT THRU P2600-EXIT.
       P2500-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      * LAST RESORT - THE TARIFF-FILED DEFAULT PIU OF 0.50000.  NO
      * PLU DEFAULT EXISTS AT THIS LEVEL SO PLU IS SET TO THE SAME
      * FIGURE, MATCHING LONGSTANDING PRACTICE - SEE V1.03 ABOVE.
       P2600-APPLY-TARIFF-DEFAULT.
           MOVE WS-TARIFF-PIU-DEFAULT TO WS-EFFECTIVE-PIU.
           MOVE WS-TARIFF-PIU-DEFAULT TO WS-EFFECTIVE-PLU.
           MOVE 'T' TO WS-FACTOR-SOURCE-CD.
       P2600-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      * SPLITS THE CONVERSATION MINUTES BY THE EFFECTIVE PIU.  THE
      * INTERSTATE PORTION ROUNDS, THE INTRASTATE REMAINDER TRUNCATES
      * - THE TWO COMPUTES FOLLOW DIFFERENT RULES, PER THE
      * ESTATE ROUNDING CONVENTION.  DO NOT MAKE THESE MATCH.
       P2700-SPLIT-MINUTES.
           MOVE CD-VC-CONV-MIN TO WS-TOTAL-MIN.
           COMPUTE WS-INTERSTATE-MIN ROUNDED =
               WS-TOTAL-MIN * WS-EFFECTIVE-PIU.
           COMPUTE WS-INTRASTATE-MIN = WS-TOTAL-MIN - WS-INTERSTATE-MIN.
           MOVE WS-INTERSTATE-MIN TO CD-VC-CHG-MIN.
       P2700-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       P2800-VALIDATE-PIU-RANGE.
           IF WS-FACTOR-SOURCE-CD = SPACE
               NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
               IF WS-EFFECTIVE-PIU < WS-PIU-LOW-LIMIT
                   MOVE EC-PIU-OUT-OF-RANGE TO WS-FAIL-ERR-CD
                   MOVE 'N' TO WS-REC-VALID-SW
               ELSE
                   IF WS-EFFECTIVE-PIU > WS-PIU-HIGH-LIMIT
                       MOVE EC-PIU-OUT-OF-RANGE TO WS-FAIL-ERR-CD
                       MOVE 'N' TO WS-REC-VALID-SW.
       P2800-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       P2900-WRITE-JUROUT.
           WRITE JUR-OUT-RECORD FROM CABS-CDR-RECORD.
           ADD 1 TO WS-WRITE-CNT.
           MOVE CD-SEQ-NBR TO HS-HASH-SEQ-IN.
           MOVE CD-OCN     TO HS-HASH-OCN-IN.
           CALL 'CABHASH' USING WS-ACC-SEQ-HASH HS-HASH-SEQ-IN
                                 WS-ACC-OCN-HASH HS-HASH-OCN-IN.
           ADD CD-VC-CONV-MIN TO WS-ACC-MINUTES.
       P2900-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      * IF NO SPECIFIC EDIT SET WS-FAIL-ERR-CD, THE RECORD STILL
      * CAME HERE INDETERMINATE WITH NO USABLE FACTOR - EC-JURIS-
      * INDET / EC-FACTOR-MISSING COVER THAT CASE.
       P3000-BUILD-SUSPENSE.
           IF WS-FAIL-ERR-CD = SPACES
               IF WS-FACTOR-SOURCE-CD = SPACE
                   MOVE EC-JURIS-INDET TO WS-FAIL-ERR-CD
               ELSE
                   MOVE EC-FACTOR-MISSING TO WS-FAIL-ERR-CD.
           MOVE WS-FAIL-ERR-CD  TO SU-ERR-CODE.
           MOVE 'E'             TO SU-ERR-SEVERITY.
           MOVE WS-PGM-NAME     TO SU-DETECT-PGM.
           MOVE 'P2300-RESOLVE-INDETERMINATE' TO WS-DETECT-PARA-LIT.
           MOVE WS-DETECT-PARA-LIT TO SU-DETECT-PARA.
           MOVE CT-RUN-ID       TO SU-RUN-ID.
           MOVE CABS-CDR-RECORD TO SU-ORIG-RECORD.
           MOVE SPACES          TO SU-FILLER.
           CALL 'CABERRWR' USING CABS-SUSPENSE-RECORD.
           WRITE SUS-OUT-RECORD FROM CABS-SUSPENSE-RECORD.
           ADD 1 TO WS-REJECT-CNT.
       P3000-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       S800-CONTROL SECTION.
       P8000-CONTROL.
           MOVE WS-PGM-NAME    TO CT-JOBNAME.
           MOVE WS-CTL-STEP-SAVE TO CT-STEPNAME.
           MOVE ZERO           TO CT-BILL-PERIOD.
           MOVE ZERO           TO CT-RERUN-NBR.
           MOVE WS-READ-CNT    TO CT-READ.
           MOVE WS-WRITE-CNT   TO CT-WRITTEN.
           MOVE WS-REJECT-CNT  TO CT-REJECTED.
           MOVE ZERO           TO CT-SUMMARISED.
           MOVE ZERO           TO CT-CARRIED-FWD.
           MOVE WS-ACC-MINUTES TO CT-HASH-MINUTES.
           MOVE WS-ACC-AMOUNT  TO CT-HASH-AMOUNT.
           MOVE WS-ACC-SEQ-HASH TO CT-HASH-SEQ.
           MOVE WS-ACC-OCN-HASH TO CT-HASH-OCN.
           IF CT-READ = CT-WRITTEN + CT-REJECTED
                        + CT-SUMMARISED + CT-CARRIED-FWD
               MOVE 'B' TO CT-BAL-IND
           ELSE
               MOVE 'O' TO CT-BAL-IND.
           MOVE ZERO   TO CT-RC.
           MOVE SPACES TO CT-ABEND-CD.
           MOVE SPACES TO CT-RESTART-KEY.
           MOVE SPACES TO CT-FILLER.
           WRITE CTL-OUT-RECORD FROM CABS-CONTROL-RECORD.
       P8000-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       S900-TERM SECTION.
       P9000-TERM.
           CLOSE ENRIN.
           CLOSE FCTRIN.
           CLOSE CARRMST.
           CLOSE JUROUT.
           CLOSE SUSOUT.
           CLOSE CTLOUT.
       P9000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
